### Crear un producto
POST http://localhost:5226/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Parlante portátil",
  "price": 25000
}

### Consultar los productos
GET http://localhost:5226/api/products

### Modificar el producto
PUT http://localhost:5226/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Parlante portátil",
  "price": 30000
}

### Eliminar el producto
DELETE http://localhost:5226/api/products/1